BlackBox HFT
Third-party software and attributions

This file lists third-party work that BlackBox HFT depends on directly or adapts. Transitive
dependencies are recorded in Cargo.lock and web/package-lock.json under their own licenses.
License evidence for each entry is in docs/RESEARCH_AND_SOURCES.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HftBacktest
https://github.com/nkaz001/hftbacktest
Copyright (c) nkaz001. MIT License.

Used unmodified as the simulation engine (Rust crate `hftbacktest` =0.9.4, `backtest` feature).

Two algorithms in crates/bb-data are Rust ports of the project's Python reference implementation:
  - Tardis CSV conversion and snapshot handling
    (py-hftbacktest/hftbacktest/data/utils/tardis.py)
  - Local-timestamp correction and exchange/local event-order correction
    (py-hftbacktest/hftbacktest/data/validation.py)

